0..77 Comment "// A package is its `package.gandr` and its `sources`. That file declares the"
78..150 Comment "// package\'s model, and `gandr check` writes `gandr.toml` beside it. Its"
151..228 Comment "// modules sit under `src`, and its version is the one the workspace above it"
229..239 Comment "// states."
